# The plural year noun that frames a decade ("os anos 80"); the singular
# "ano" names a single year ("o ano 1980", the ordinary way to write a
# year) and must not reach the decade slot.
# Source: Dicionario Priberam da Lingua Portuguesa, s.v. "ano"
# (https://dicionario.priberam.org/ano), which lists the plural as its own
# entry: "anos, nome masculino plural".
anos
